Current filename/RTL mapping and additional attribution (2026-10-28)
-----------------------------------------------------------------
Original notices above are retained. Current draft files are
mail-drafts-symbolic.svg and mail-drafts-symbolic-rtl.svg; both retain the
GNOME Project CC-BY-SA-3.0 base/adaptation terms. Sent/RTL and tag/RTL variants
retain their base attribution plus project adaptation credits.
GNOME-derived edit/list work: GNOME Project, https://www.gnome.org; upstream
LGPLv3 or CC-BY-SA-3.0 grant and AUTHORS are supplied in the licence directory.
Project contributions include James Westman (font/toolbar icons), Nikolas Tapia
(lists), Alexander Wilms (edit import), Michael Gratton and Jeremy Bicha
(RTL/adaptations), Tobias Bernard (symbolic refinements), and Daniel Elia
(Convey reply-to-list). Import credit is not a claim of sole original creation.
See installed ARTWORK-INVENTORY.md for every installed path and licence basis.
Separate CC/PD/third-party terms are not overwritten by the application GPL copy.
